OL,3,AMore talks over Drumcree dispute as
OL,4,Astalemate continues
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Northern Ireland Secretary, Sir
OL,7,FChris Bryant, is planning further talks
OL,8,Fon Wednesday over the the controversial
OL,9,FDrumcree march.
OL,11,FIt comes after lawyers for the Garvaghy
OL,12,FRoad Residents Coalition issued a fresh
OL,13,Flegal bid to try to prevent the march
OL,14,Ffrom going ahead.
OL,16,FMembers of the Orange Order are still
OL,17,Fwaiting to begin their permitted
OL,18,Fparade, which was due to take place on
OL,19,FSunday, and walk down the
OL,20,Fmainly-nationalist Garvaghy Road in
OL,21,FPortadown.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
